@Dsw2026Tpi.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7001
@accessToken = 

### Health Check
GET {{Dsw2026Tpi.Api_HostAddress}}/health-check
Accept: application/json

### Crear especialidad
POST {{host}}/api/specialties Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}} Content-Type: application/json 
{ 
  "name": "Cardiología",
  "description": "Atención y control cardiovascular"
}  

### Listar especialidades 

GET {{host}}/api/specialties?pageSize=10&pageIndex=0 
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Crear médico 
POST {{host}}/api/doctors
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "name": "Ana Pérez",
  "licenseNumber": "MP-12345", 
  "specialityId": "{{specialityId}}"
} 

